20230627 - Fixes/optimizations/tweaks:
1. Adjust and optimize the investment interface and values;
2. Fix the problem that the stock market (occasionally) cannot be opened;
3. Fix the problem that the holding share is abnormal after the store is listed;
4. Add 5 new books to add five-dimensional attributes;
5. Adjust the value of books and food.
*When the version is updated, there may be abnormal problems in the old archive, it is recommended to use the new archive to play.

20230622 - BUG fixes/optimizations/adjustments:
1. Fix the problem of not dying when the fullness is negative;
2. Fix the problem that the BUFF increase "receipt UI" displays abnormally;
3. Fix the problem that the buttons display abnormally after sacrificing all NPCs;
4. Fixed the problem of receiving unlimited calendar rewards;
5. Fix the problem that the stock market is always closed;
6. Fix the problem of abnormal judgment of big talk dice;
7. Fix the problem of repeated refreshing after the auction exits the interface;
8. Fix the problem of abnormal identification times of antiques;
9. Fix the problem that the effect of collection items is abnormal after lying flat;
10. The problem of infinitely increasing research and development when repairing investment;
11. Fix the problem of abnormal BUFF bonus;
12. Adjust the probability of obtaining collectibles in random events;
13. Tips for optimizing investment and increasing research and development.

20230621 - BUG fixes/optimizations/adjustments:
1. Fix the problem of abnormal five-dimensional attributes after reading books;
2. Fix the stuck problem of random events;
3. Fix the problem of duplicate collectibles in the auction;
4. Fix the problem of duplicate collectibles and stuck in random events;
5. Optimize and adjust investment value
6. Adjust the action points that need to be consumed by the plot: every time you enter a plot, the action points that need to be consumed next time will be doubled (1/2/4/8...)—to avoid the problem of numerical explosion caused by the plot.
